  "title": "Kicked Jamaican Chickpeas Curry",
  "description": "A kid-friendly Jamaican dish featuring chickpeas in a fluffy and flavorful curry sauce, made with fermented ingredients and halal-friendly spices.",
  "cuisine": "Jamaican",
